WEBVTT

00:00:03.177 --> 00:00:08.717
An Azure AI Inference connection asks for the Endpoint of the inference service.

00:00:09.441 --> 00:00:16.498
Authentication type is Default authentication, API key, or Managed identity, with an optional

00:00:16.498 --> 00:00:18.850
Managed identity client ID.

00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.701
Choose API key, and enter the key.

